{"id":"96978d2a748174af","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-independence.md","title":"可数 join 的删列与可计算独立性","display":"df-computable-independence — 可数 join 的删列与可计算独立性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-independence","aliases":["20-df-computable-independence"],"display":"df-computable-independence — 可数 join 的删列与可计算独立性","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 6.1.3；Exercise 6.1.4","source_printed_pages":[133],"source_pdf_pages":[167],"depends_on":["[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-independence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-independence — 可数 join 的删列与可计算独立性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.1.3；Exercise 6.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>133</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\">\\(\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为自然数集合序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A):=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\ne i\\land x\\in A_j\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [A_i\\not\\le_TJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A):=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\ne i\\land x\\in A_j\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [A_i\\not\\le_TJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>删列后保留列号并将第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列置空。它与通过有效双射重排其余列的 join 可计算同构。独立性要求单列不能由全部其余列共同计算，强于逐对不可比；序列本身不预设任何有效性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.1.3；Exercise 6.1.4；印刷页 133；PDF 第 167 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A):=\\{\\langle j,x\\rangle:j\\ne i\\land x\\in A_j\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [A_i\\not\\le_TJ_{\\ne i}(\\vec A)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1416,"backlinks":[{"id":"404345cb6603a5c9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"bb045b68eb24d902","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"22bad1b580e74bd2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"133865925995a5f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"